%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-properties (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
      host: "localhost",
      port: "1234"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload text/x-java-properties
host=localhost
port=1234
%%% output application/dw
{
  port: "1234",
  host: "localhost"
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "text/x-java-properties"}
